It is Thursday evening.
It is now half past six.
Today we played very good badminton.
I went to the club's counter.
I returned my rented racket.
"Brother, please take this," I said.
The brother at the counter smiled.
He said, "Thank you, madam."
I picked up my bag.
Amit, Neha, and Sanjay are standing near the courts.
They are waiting for me.
I went to them.
Amit asked, "Maya, are you ready?"
I answered, "Yes, I am absolutely ready."
Sanjay said, "I got very tired today."
Neha laughed.
She said, "Come on, let's go outside now."
We picked up our things.
We all came out of the club.
The evening breeze is very nice.
